      "path": "cordis.patch.yml",
      "text": "# dsh tavily bundle patch.\n#\n# One insert mounts the Host half. The browser half is declared by the\n# `dsh.client` field in package.json and binds to this row because the row's\n# `id` equals the package name's last segment — the client half is attached to\n# the bare package-name row, and subpath rows never carry one.\n#\n# `id: tavily` is also the settings namespace: the settings page reads and\n# writes the entry's Config through `ctx.configForms.get('tavily')`, so this\n# id, the settings namespace, and the `ctx.web` provider id are all `tavily`\n# and must stay in agreement.\n- insert:\n    - id: tavily\n      name: '@zx06/tavily'\n      config: {}\n"
    }
